# Crystal Imperium play test: the summary shows the nature set with the Training Kit (L menu >
# STATS > NATURE), the one the stats follow, not the nature the Pokemon was born with (fixed in
# 0.11.0: the summary printed the personality's nature).
!new_game()
# A Lv 11 Cyndaquil born HARDY (the debug menu sets the personality's nature)
!give_mon_complex("SPECIES_CYNDAQUIL", 11, "NATURE_HARDY", 0, ["MOVE_TACKLE", "MOVE_LEER", "MOVE_EMBER", "MOVE_NONE"])

# L > STATS > NATURE > Cyndaquil > MODEST (list index 15)
!l_menu("STATS")
press A
wait 120
press A
wait 120
!["press DOWN"] * 15
press A
wait 60
shot 01_modest.png
mash A 120
wait 60
# The stats follow MODEST: Attack 19 x0.9, Sp. Atk 21 x1.1 (party stats after maxHP: +90, +96)
expect16 {gPlayerParty+90} 17 modest_attack
expect16 {gPlayerParty+96} 23 modest_spatk

# The summary's first page: "MODEST nature, met at Lv11, ..."
!start_menu("POKEMON")
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 120
shot 02_summary.png
!expect_summary_nature("NATURE_MODEST", "summary_shows_modest")
mash B 120
